window.products.push({"id":856213,"name":"HouLight Automatic Foam Soap Dispenser, Touchless High Capacity Battery Operated Hands Free Electric Foam Soap Dispenser Equipped w/ Adjustable Soap D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MXayd5gyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HouLight automatic foam soap touchless dispenser with hand motion sensor is simply amazing ! With this new design, many aspects have been improved significantly compared to previous models. Specifications Package dimensions: 8 x 6 x 4inch  Dispensing volume: adjustable.  Battery: 4 x AA batteries (NOT included)  Capacity: 12 oz/ 350 ml. Applications Homes, kitchens, bathrooms, public areas.  Compatible with foaming soaps, also compatible with diluted (3 parts of water + 1 parts of soap) common household liquid hand soap or dish soap, suitable for washing hands, dishes, etc. Question : How long can one set of 4 AA batteries last for this automatic soap dispenser? Answer : It depends on the quality of the battery and the frequency of usage. In general it can last for a few months without problems. Question : How long can the soap be used per refill? Answer : Again this depends on the use frequency and dispensing volumes. In general, for a single family, it can last for one or two months per refill. But with more frequent usage the refill will be more frequent. Question : Can this soap dispenser be used for alcohol or hand sanitizer? Answer : No. Alcohol containing liquids will corrode the material of this automatic soap dispenser over time. Question : Can this be used for dish washing soap? Answer : Yes. Besides hands washing soap, dish washing soap is also one of its main compatible soaps. However, most dish soaps are too viscous, therefore you need to dilute the dish soap with 3 parts of water before adding to the electric soap dispenser. Question : What if I still have some other questions? Answer : Whenever in need, do not hesitate to contact us and we will take care of it for you right away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MXayd5gyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HouLight","source_asin":"B08DCWSMRF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DCWSMRF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DCWSMRF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
