window.products.push({"id":856241,"name":"Koyal Wholesale 13.5\" White and Gold French Scroll Charger Plates, Bulk Set of 4 Scalloped Acrylic Plastic Charger Plates for Table Setting, Tabletop,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KZFZI3QaL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Instantly enhance each table setting with our elegant french scroll charger plates. Our charger plates are durable and made for repeat use, great for rental, hire and all occasions. When hosting a dinner party the Koyal Wholesale selection of charger plates provides a variety of choice from metal, acrylic, glass and more. The white and gold scroll edges give a elegant romantic look that will wow your guests. Our charger plates are the excellent display plate to elevate the look of your table top for any occasion from weddings and special events to everyday parties. Add glitz and glamour to your party by pairing our charger plates with napkin ring holders, candle holders and floral centerpieces for the ultimate fine dining experience. Each charger plate set is packaged securely for safe arrival.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KZFZI3QaL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koyal Wholesale","source_asin":"B07S7GK2TL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S7GK2TL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S7GK2TL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":856242,"name":"BluSpirits Handcrafted Drinking Horn Mug - Handmade Viking Tankard For Coffee, Ultimate Unique Ox Norse Mugs For Hot & Cold Drinks (Polished 01)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xJhv7NqPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"VIKING FEEL, HANDMADE BEAUTY: This unique piece of art is made of original ox horn and gives a feeling of drinking like a real Viking. Authentic design Handcrafted from the best quality, responsibly sourced Ox horns Craftsmanship at its best, BluSpirit ensure durable master pieces reach you, sculpted to perfection so that only the finest mugs get to sit on your table. 100% FOOD SAFE: you get value for every dollar to spend. Our superior technology and quality conscious artists ensure you receive 100% Food safe mugs. Each mug is coated with 100% Food safe non-toxic lacquer in order to avoid the real horn odour and to avoid leakage. CAPACITY AND UNIQUENESS: Each of our drinking horn mugs can hold around 23 to 26 Oz liquid depending on the horn size. The mugs are made of real horns therefore each mug has it’s own natural color and no two mugs are alike! This means your purchase will grant you a horn cup you can truly call your own and take pride that is one of a kind. CARE & MAINTANENCE: As these drinking horn mugs are made of real ox horn, they require a little extra care. Once used, please gently hand wash with cold water and keep them in closed place. The less they come in contact with air, the more they stay real. BluSpirit COMMITMENT: We check each and every piece with utmost care for any leakage and odour. Please be sure about the odour before buying and if you receive any piece which has a little leakage, we request you to send us the picture for the same and our ever available customer services will get back to you as soon as possible with best solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xJhv7NqPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BluSpirits","source_asin":"B06WLMKCQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WLMKCQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WLMKCQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
