window.products.push({"id":856370,"name":"Nut Milk Bag 2 Pcs, GOGOUP 12\"X12\" Reusable Strainer Bags Food Straining Cloth 150&200 Micron Fine Mesh Nylon Filter Bags for Almond Milk, Juice, Cold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718XWbYypnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"150 & 200 MICRON ULTRA FINE MESH FILTERS: GOGOUP nut milk bag have two different microns to meet your different needs. 200 Micron - Recommend for filtration of vegetable juice, soybean milk, fruit juice, sweetened bean paste, spices (with residue). 150 Micron - Recommend for filtration of broth, milk, coffee, tea or liquids (filter out smaller impurities). BPA FREE & PERFECT DESIGN: GOGOUP milk filter is made of 100% polyester material, BPA-free. The material will not absorb the ingredients of the nut milk, so your nut milk will keep its natural flavor and 100% nutrition. High-quality material help us to get perfect results and a health life. Double edge won't rip or tear easily. Our mesh strainer is much easier to clean and less messy than classic cheesecloth. Drawstring for easy straining. MULTIPLE USES: Our bag strainer is wonderful gift for people who love life. GOGOUP mesh strainer bags are perfect used for homemade nut milk, almond milk, yogurt, cheese, fruit juices, cold brew, coffee, tea and so on. EASY TO CLEAN AND REUSA: GOGOUP mesh strainer bag is easy to clean and re-use. You just need turn the bag inside out and hand or machine wash in water using soap or detergent, then hung it to air dry. Additionally, you can also dip the bag into boiling water. Boiling water will not cause any damage to the milk bag. Please make sure the bag already cooled down to room temperature before use. Be sure to let them dry thoroughly before storing. LARGE SIZE AND 100% FULL REFUND GUARANTEE: The size of the nut milk strainer is 12X12 inches, large enough for family use. You can ask us any question before or after the purchase, we will reply as soon as possible. We have 100% confident in the quality of our almond milk bag, don't worry, just place your order. If you're not satisfied with the product, simply return them for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718XWbYypnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOGOUP","source_asin":"B07WQWTJ6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WQWTJ6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WQWTJ6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
