window.products.push({"id":856496,"name":"SAMSUNG BESPOKE Jet Cordless Stick Vacuum Cleaner with All In One Clean Station, Powerful Floor Cleaning for Carpet, Hardwood, Tile, Lightweight, HEPA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":688.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713szUlgjhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design meets function with the new Samsung BESPOKE Jet™ Cordless Stick Vacuum. Innovative design combines a Clean Station, charging stand and powerful Jet™ Stick into one show-stopping vacuum. Available in contemporary colors and premium finishes to beautifully fit your décor and lifestyle. Built-in Clean Station lets you empty the dust bin at the press of a button while also charging your vacuum. The BESPOKE Jet™ is our most powerful jet stick yet and tackles any mess across floor types such as carpets, hard floors, and tile. The BESPOKE Jet™ is engineered around a lightweight, maneuverable design, plus a multi-stage filtration system that meets standards and maintains cleaner air in your home. Includes two removable batteries for a cleaning time up to 120 minutes. The lightweight design lets you easily maneuver the vacuum to clean on stairs, under sofas, and in other hard-to-reach places. Dustbin can be easily washed to maintain optimal condition and performance. Pipe adjusts to three different lengths to reach certain spots or provide a more comfortable height. Take the hassle out of removing unsightly pet hair. The compact and maneuverable Pet Tool’s brush is optimized for picking up pet hairs. Samsung Bespoke appliances come with an extended warranty for 2 years of coverage.**** *Based on the IEC 62885-2:2016 and EN 60312-1:2017 Filtration efficiency standard by SLG Pruf-und Zertifizierungs GmbH tests. 5-layer filtration and vacuum tested at the inlet of the non-motorized tool, using Jet mode. **Microdust particles include particle sizes from 0.5 to 4.2 micrometers in diameter. ***Based on the IEST RP CC001.6(2016) standard as tested by SGS IBR Laboratories. 5-layer filtration and vacuum tested at the inlet of the non-motorized tool, using Jet mode. ****Purchase date of eligible models must be between 10/1/2022–9/30/2023; proof of purchase required. For full warranty terms and conditions for specific models, see individual model product page on Samsung.com.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713szUlgjhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B0B8WB4V33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8WB4V33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8WB4V33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
