window.products.push({"id":856741,"name":"HEUNGBERANT Wood Burning Stove Fan Heat Powered Fireplace Fan for WoodLog BurnerFireplace, Black… (updated 4 blades)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6187fVvw4US._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why need to use the wood burning stove fan Without a wood burning fan, a lot of heat generated by a stove is lost as the air rises directly vertically. However, our wood burning stove fireplace fan uses its blades to divert the warm air horizontally filling the whole room as opposed to the area directly between the stove and the ceiling! How does our stove fan work Our log burner fan requires no electricity or batteries to operate, it uses the heat from your stove to power the fan and efficiently disperses the heat around your room. Our wood stove fan will also reduce the heat dependency from your stove thereby saving your money in the long term on fuel costs. The stove fan runs without batteries,cords or electricity,it generates its own power by the heat from the stove surface.The base of the fan transmits the heat to electricity generating units,and electricity generating units convert the heat energy into kinetic energy to drive the motor,then the blades spin. Specifications Size: 21Lx 11.5W x 21.5H cm Net Weight: 580g Recommended Operating Temperature: 200DegreeC-300DegreeC/392DegreeF-572DegreeF Noise: Warnings and Tips 1. Never handle the base of the wood burning stove fan, do not set the fireplace fan down on an unprotected surface when the surface is very hot. 2. Do NOT place the log burner fan in front of chimney pipe, too close to the chimney will reduce its performance, and even cause fan damage by overheat, the optimum position is at the top or the side part of the stove top. 3. To move or carry the wood burning stove fan, always use the extendable handle while wearing gloves. 4. Keep heat powered fan away from small children when in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6187fVvw4US._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HEUNGBERANT","source_asin":"B099DM8YMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099DM8YMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099DM8YMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
