window.products.push({"id":856751,"name":"FRIEET Fairy Lights, 12 Pack Fairy Lights Battery Operated, 7.2ft 20 Leds String Lights Silver Coated Copper Wire Firefly Starry Lights for Bedroom Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c-qFB8SAL._AC_.jpg","description":"IDEAL SPECIFICATION - With 12 pack string lights, each string light has 20 mini LED lights. The quantity of 12 packs is very appropriate. You are able to decorate for different places, like the fence in the garden, photo wall in the bedroom, a potted plant on the dining table, an empty wine bottle, etc. Adding some extra warmth and fun to your life. SPECIAL DIY DECORATION & GIFT - The starry fairy light is made of high quality and soft silver coated copper wire. Easy to bend into any shape flexibly or wrap it on anything you want, like plants, flowers, wine bottles, gifts, wedding decoration and so on. It is also highly recommended to create a unique DIY gift for your lover, family members, friends, or teachers. SAFE & WATERPROOF - With low voltage batteries and heat insulation silver wire, this LED light is certified by UL588, making it has a low energy consumption. It is safe to touch and with no danger of burns after using it for a long time. In addition, the moon lights adopt IP65 waterproof silver copper wire, which can be immersed into water to create a gorgeous light and shadow. It is ideal for indoor and outdoor decor. But the battery box is not waterproof, please place it properly. LONG LIFE BATTERY POWERED - Each string light needs 2 x CR2032 battery( included), which supports 48 hours continuous working. So there is no need to consider the location of the socket or the length of the wire. The battery case with a very small ON/OFF switch, which is easy to operate and hide. When the LED fairy lights dim, you can easily replace the battery by using the small screwdriver(included). MULTI SCENE USED - The fairy lights will emit soft and warm light, which can protect your eyes. It could create a romantic and warm atmosphere in any place like home, bedroom, patio, balcony, garden, fence, bar, café, supermarket, flower shop, etc. It is also the best decoration choice on Christmas, Valentine's day, Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, New Year, birthday, party, anniversary, wedding or other special days. If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c-qFB8SAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRIEET","source_asin":"B07DCPLG3L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DCPLG3L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DCPLG3L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
