window.products.push({"id":856781,"name":"Red Fleece Christmas Stockings - 3-Pack of 18 inch Holiday Stockings with Festive 3D Santa Claus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51umROIH2gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This set of 3 red Santa stockings with three-dimensional details are perfect for the entire family! They will look cozy and friendly to make your space feel warm this holiday season. Get one for each member and fill them up with custom surprises and gifts, that show how much you love them. They have dimensional details, feature an embroidered beard and super-soft plush cuff; also have a pom accent and a faux leather belt, for added textures and details! At 18\" long, there is lots of room for stocking stuffers and gifts, making Christmas morning surprises even more special for everyone. They are made of fleece, velvet, faux leather, and polyester, and includes a loop for hanging, so you can easily hang them anywhere!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51umROIH2gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Traditions Simplify Your Holiday","source_asin":"B07S2T5JCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S2T5JCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S2T5JCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":856782,"name":"Factory Reconditioned Delonghi AD1079S Solo Rotisserie Convection Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413f9E4F1hL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Delong Solo Rotisserie Convection oven has extra large 1.1 cubic foot capacity with 2 Hour Timer with Safety Auto Shut Off. Digital controls with LCD display makes cooking simple and fast. Interior light allows you to safely view and monitor food. There are 8 possible cooking functions including bake, bake with convection, broil, keep warm, defrost, rotisserie, pizza function and dehydrate make this the ideal multi-function oven. And also two-tier cooking capability allows you to cook two different dishes simultaneously with out sacrificing performance. Drop down top heating element allows you to easily clean the top of the oven. This Oven comes with other accessories includes 2 cooking racks, 2 low profile DuraStone enamel bake pan, rotisserie kit, DuraStone enamel rotisserie pan , and pizza tray. Amazon.com The latest invention from a long line of quality kitchen products from DeLonghi. Their Airstream Convection Oven is extra-large with an interior space of 1.1 cubic feet, accommodating many types of foods from 12-inch frozen pizzas to rotisserie chickens -- all without having to heat up the kitchen! Eight possible cooking functions allow you to bake with or without convection, broil, keep warm, and defrost. A special Pizza function turns out a pizza with the crispiest, most golden crust. The oven's unique \"Heat Circ\" technology, dual heating elements and patented enamel interior enable the twice-heated air to be displaced over the food more evenly and directly, reducing cooking time by up to a half -- a timesaver for you! The upper and lower racks allow you to cook two dishes simultaneously. And once you're finished, cleaning the interior is a simple task thanks to the ingenious design of the heating element: it's partially suspended from the interior's ceiling so you can easily wipe up any splatters on top after the oven cools. What's in the Box: Oven, interior light, two-hour timer with auto shut-off, digital controls with LCD display, cooking rack, two baking pans, a 12.5-inch rotisserie spit that attaches and detaches easily, and pizza tray accessory.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413f9E4F1hL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B0002YTX2U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002YTX2U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002YTX2U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
