window.products.push({"id":856784,"name":"Metal Straws, 10.5\" Set of 4 Reusable Silver Stainless Steel Straws with Cleaning Brush, Extra Long Drinking Straws for 30oz Tumbler(2 Straight, 2 Ben","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ahm2+4CRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【10.5 inch Tall Metal Straws】Long stainless steel straws come with different shapes of straight and bent, perfect for tall cups, big water mug, 24/30/32 oz tumblers. You will get 4 metal straws: 2 straight straws & 2 bent straws, 1 cleaning brush, 1 drawstring bag. The straws are thin(6mm opening), so they won't work for bubble tea or very thick smoothies. 【Sturdy, Eco-friendly】Made of food grade stainless steel with good quality, you will feel them very smooth on the lips, no irritation, no weird metallic taste. Straws are durable, rust proof, dishwasher safe and eco-friendly, awesome alternative to disposable plastic straws for the environment, saving the turtles! 【Reusable Straws with Cleaner Brush】The nylon bristles on the brush are semi-hard, flexible but not flimsy, they have the perfect stiffness to clean the inside of the straws, so to keep the straws cleaned and sanitary is a breeze. The brush handles are also made of quality stainless steel, ending in a round loop which is nice for hanging to dry. 【Washable, Portable Carry Bag】Everything comes in a handy storage pouch which is nice for you to place the straws safely in your purse/backpack to take on the go, very convenient for everyday use at home or work or travel. The benifit of little lightweight sets is that you can keep one set in your car, one set in your purse, etc. Very practical. 【Perfect Small Thoughtful Gift】Metal drinking straws set as gifts is a good idea about reducing plastic usage, they are economical and user friendly, get multiple packages of these steel straws to give out for family members of friends as birthday gifts, Christmas gifts, encourage others to be more eco-friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ahm2+4CRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Izurok","source_asin":"B097NZLG82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097NZLG82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097NZLG82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
