window.products.push({"id":856861,"name":"Half Gallon Clear Plastic Jug (2 Pack) - BPA Free 64 Ounce Jug - Wide Mouth Jug - Easy Grip Handle - Airtight Caps with Foam Liner - PETG Oblong Recta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617PwPL3i4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made in the USA: Made of premium quality PETG, our half gallon oblong jugs are BPA-free, food grade, and reusable. Our clear bottles and air-tight caps make storing and identifying the contents easy! Use our clear rectangular bottles for powder laundry detergent, fabric softener, bath salts, sugar, coffee beans, oats, cereal, and more! Easy Grip Handle: Our half gallon container is designed with a handle to make carrying and pouring easy and efficient. Our small jug is great for storing in campers, RV’s, cars and/or car trunks, and more! The rectangular shape also makes our plastic jugs easy to store on shelfs, helping you save precious storage space. Perfect for your kitchen, pantry, bathroom, and more. Airtight Caps: Our black 70mm 70-400 caps are made with a ribbed sided design to make unscrewing and securing the lid easy. Our caps include a polyethylene foam liner, ensuring that our caps are leak-proof and spill resistant. The tight seal from our caps prevents odors from permeating the contents. The wide mouth is also the perfect size to conveniently keep a scoop for dispensing. Labels Included: We’ve permanent adhesive labels to help you easily identify contents. This is great for storing and identifying common household items. Our labels are inkjet and laser printer compatible, so you can easily customize them as you see fit. Great Value Pack: Our value pack includes 2 clear oblong rectangular plastic jugs, 2 airtight caps, and a page of stickers. The jugs have a 64-ounce capacity each. Dimensions of the jug are approximately 5.526” Length x 3.776” Width x 7.71” Height. The caps are 70mm 70-400 and measure 2.86” Diameter x 0.48” Height. Hand wash only - high heat can distort or even melt plastic. Our clear jugs are *not* dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617PwPL3i4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stock Your Home","source_asin":"B098YH1Q8H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-856861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098YH1Q8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098YH1Q8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
